@baseUrl = http://localhost:5006
@adminToken = replace-with-an-admin-access-token
@guardianToken = replace-with-a-guardian-access-token
@guardianId = 1
@studentId = 1

### List guardians and their linked students (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/guardians
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Get one guardian (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/guardians/{{guardianId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Register a parent (Admin); copy the one-time temporary password from the response
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/register-parent
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Aster",
  "lastName": "Example",
  "email": "aster.parent@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+251900000000"
}

### Link a registered guardian to a student (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/guardians/link-student
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guardianId": {{guardianId}},
  "studentId": {{studentId}},
  "relationship": "Mother"
}

### The authenticated guardian's linked students only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/parent/my-students
Authorization: Bearer {{guardianToken}}

### Attendance for a linked student; an unlinked ID must return 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/parent/student/{{studentId}}/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{guardianToken}}

### Published results for a linked student; an unlinked ID must return 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/parent/student/{{studentId}}/results
Authorization: Bearer {{guardianToken}}

### Report card PDF for a linked student; an unlinked ID must return 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/parent/student/{{studentId}}/report-card-pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{guardianToken}}
Accept: application/pdf
